// builds — until this same pass switched it to wagerwise_pll__(), so these
// need registering too or they'd just silently stay English. Registered
// here rather than the 17MB seed.php given that file's own documented
// batch-edit fragility; this script is simply the safer place to add them.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

